I’ve confirmed all four base configs use `epochs`, and their full budget is 60. The other three methods’ loss paths already enforce exact prediction/target equality through `DiceFocalLoss`; HeteroSFL needs alignment in both training branches and evaluation because its decoder output remains half-resolution. I’m also adding explicit best-IoU/best-Dice state so the final report names both best and last metrics instead of hiding drift.
